  <metadata>
    <name>Gusinje (Martinoviće) – Višnjevo (PL01)</name>
    <desc>The Biking Trail PL01 offers 25.5 km of easy riding mostly on asphalt through the surroundings of Plav. The total ascent is 112 m, descent 118 m, and the ride without breaks takes about 1 h 30 min. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
